{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>屯門湖景路爆食水管。今日（28日）下午3時許，湖景路近湖翠樓對開一地盤有水管爆裂。現場圖片可見，地盤內「水浸」，馬路積水數吋深，車輛涉水而行時濺起水花。</p><p>水務署於Facebook專頁「滴惜仔」表示，接獲報告指屯門湖景路建築地盤內，有食水管滲漏，已派員前往現場跟進。</p><figure><img alt=\"現場為屯門湖景路，地盤內出現「水浸」。（Osborn Yu / 真.屯門友）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136725217503612928147690.jpeg/9XeC1DnKEwLRvFbv7bEC8KoWPR54HQU2_EnCRfxJwkU\"/><figcaption>現場為屯門湖景路，地盤內出現「水浸」。（Osborn Yu / 真.屯門友）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為屯門湖景路，可見路面被積水淹浸，車輛涉水而行。（屯門友 Facebook）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136725205951975424931476.jpeg/tmtMUsOZwCplJGhvX-aEPfaE2fcbUvMPUotqPVKLaj0\"/><figcaption>現場為屯門湖景路，可見路面被積水淹浸，車輛涉水而行。（屯門友 Facebook）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為屯門湖景路（屯門友 Facebook）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136725208388997120821704.jpeg/PYsgHiIudxhwqCF-qe9Juen0dWCTgkq8OQGP1zkBj9c\"/><figcaption>現場為屯門湖景路（屯門友 Facebook）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為屯門湖景路，可見路面被積水淹浸，車輛涉水而行。（屯門友 Facebook）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136725211488718848385461.jpeg/CvhYBbsnEVJ1svveLMXG4RGYjdFpgSB0nBCrK5wQqys\"/><figcaption>現場為屯門湖景路，可見路面被積水淹浸，車輛涉水而行。（屯門友 Facebook）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為屯門湖景路，路面被積水淹浸。（屯門友 Facebook）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136725214877847552381659.jpeg/WyCcPTl2OPAHUkJe_lbfwik6s7Fb3zJRitSRaYrUkWk\"/><figcaption>現場為屯門湖景路，路面被積水淹浸。（屯門友 Facebook）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-28T10:38:35.285431+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":308,"images":5,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}